      weather: `<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4.2"/><path d="M12 3v2.4M12 18.6V21M3 12h2.4M18.6 12H21M5.6 5.6l1.7 1.7M16.7 16.7l1.7 1.7M18.4 5.6l-1.7 1.7M7.3 16.7l-1.7 1.7"/></svg>`,
